  "title": "7 Causes of AI Chatbot Wrong Answers",
  "summary": "Quick answer: AI chatbots give wrong answers for a handful of predictable reasons: outdated or missing knowledge, conflicting content, unstructured source material, weak retrieval, LLM hallucination, and no feedback loop to catch errors. The fix is rarely a better model. It is trusted, governed knowledge, strong grounding, and continuous optimization. When an AI chatbot gives...",
